  {
   "k": "1345498",
   "en": "The below is ⟦0⟧ player suggested strategies for ⟦1⟧. Bear in mind, due to the dynamic nature of the game, it may unfold differently for other players.",
   "frags": 2
  },
  {
   "k": "wcbrz4",
   "en": "A good strategy for Tannu Tuva is to exploit the ⟦0⟧ for military help in China. Since they generally don't have any interest in the area, should the player beat Japan to it, they can gain huge amounts of manpower, even by taking out only the warlords.",
   "frags": 1
  },
  {
   "k": "gwg8wi",
   "en": "One should start by attacking ⟦0⟧ since it is the weakest of the warlords that Tannu Tuva is able to attack. After peacing out with them, by either annexing or puppeting, it is recommended that the player attacks ⟦1⟧ as ⟦2⟧ is better defended. Take out as many warlords as possible until the Marco Polo Bridge incident occurs and Japan and the United Front are at all-out war. It is suggested then that the player attacks alongside ⟦3⟧, calling the Soviets, as previously stated, Tannu Tuva's communist allies won't take land away or make puppets, this includes ⟦4⟧ too. Use the tactic 'Shadow Puppeting⟦5⟧FeedBackGaming⟦6⟧",
   "frags": 7
  },
